{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Flight</strong> is a side-scrolling endless runner set in a magical forest. The player is a witch whose mission is to make it as far as possible while dodging spooky enemies and throwing fireballs at them. How long can you survive the natural and the supernatural challenges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142660/extras/89a930a2157dd637e18fd73b240d9b37.avif?t=1774784571\" width=1385 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge enemies</strong>\u00a0to keep going and increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142660/extras/2e5106b2f624104951a42503f38a5f99.avif?t=1774784571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142660/extras_big/2e5106b2f624104951a42503f38a5f99.webp?t=1774784571 width=1560 height=832 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect potions</strong>\u00a0to heal yourself or gain mana for casting fireballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142660/extras/72ff601ba554eba0332a8f8557ed0110.avif?t=1774784571\" width=948 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot fireballs</strong>\u00a0at enemies to destroy them and gain extra points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142660/extras/807188591d6addd8329f50dcb50311da.avif?t=1774784571\" data-b